      "role": "user",
      "content": "Those are good archetypes. To really drive home the contrast between the \"high-class\" investigator and the \"low-life\" underworld, I want to make sure the grit feels real. Can you describe a scene where the protagonist has to go into one of their neighborhoods to get information? I want to see how the environment and the people in it reflect that sense of danger and decay.",
